  "summary": [
    "Choose Python or Bash by task; Python uses the standard library by default",
    "Distributed Python scripts must have tests named test_{module}.py, with directories matching skill names",
    "SKILL.md must not contain inline logic; call independent scripts instead",
    "Placement of scripts and docs: per-skill versus plugin-wide, no direct references to other skills",
    "Temp files go under .temp/<plugin>/<skill>/ written with the Write tool, not shell",
    "Distributed artifacts must not reference development-only docs",
    "Other components are accessed only through SKILL contracts",
    "Delete unused code; do not parse AI-interpreted input in scripts",
    "Fallbacks must be explainable recoveries, otherwise report errors explicitly",
    "Version files are not edited in ordinary work; release procedure owns them"
  ],
